# Tauri generated schemas (regenerated by `tauri dev` / `tauri build`)
src-tauri/gen/

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# OS files
